        "original_id": "86f6801d-e6a4-55a2-b1dc-1bd960915701",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Thorpe, Eddie Mahan\n- Organizations: Indians team, Sac and Fox Nation\n- Places: LaRue, Ohio\n- Topics: Native American athletes, football\n\nFacts:\n- The Indians team was based in LaRue, Ohio, was composed only of Native Americans, and was coached by Jim Thorpe.\n- Jim Thorpe was a member of the Sac and Fox Nation.\n- Jim Thorpe became the first Native American to win a gold medal for his home country.\n- Eddie Mahan was widely regarded as one of the greatest football players in the first 50 years of the sport.\n- Jim Thorpe named Eddie Mahan the greatest football player of all time.",
